20:18.160 --> 20:19.690
Sayangnya, dah terlambat.

20:20.350 --> 20:21.680
Dia dah ada anak lelaki.

20:22.960 --> 20:23.750
Awak, Gu Pingyuan

20:23.750 --> 20:25.080
