34:03.590 --> 34:04.440
Jika begitu...

34:04.440 --> 34:04.900
Awak...

34:48.230 --> 34:48.860
Terima kasih.

34:48.860 --> 34:49.500
Selamat jalan.

34:48.880 --> 34:53.139
